19	NO-NO-DUH	nonoduh.png	I Have a Dream	17		7:00 PM			$7.00			5:47 PM	Monday, January 19, 2026	I have a dream that one day this kennel will rise up and live out the true meaning of its creed: “We hold these truths to be self-evident, that all hashers are created equal.”<br /><br />I have a dream that no hasher shall ever be limited geographically by an arbitrary line on a map or a distance too great for a spontaneous trip.<br /><br />I have a dream that our freedom to run will never be curtailed because an inactive or sclerotic kennel or self-proclaimed grand tyrant exists; the spirit of the Hash lives in the feet, not in the ledger book.<br /><br /><b>I have a dream that no hasher shall have their hard-won events or memories deleted from the calendar or erased from the annals of the On-On.</b><br /><br />I have a dream that one day, down in the deep shiggy of past disappointments, the sons of former rivals and the sons of former critics will be able to sit down together at the table of the circle and of the on-in, and all hashers can look beyond past prejudice and see the good that others bring to the trail.<br /><br />I have a dream that one day every stream shall be crossed, every down-down performed, and the glory of the Hash shall be revealed, and all hashers shall see it together.<br /><br />I have a dream that our circle, the heart of our community, shall finally be graced with the eternal blessing: that the beer will be free, and flow freely, and, most importantly, be gloriously cold!<br /><br />I have a dream that the Hares, in their infinite wisdom, will ensure that the trail will always have moderate, appropriate levels of shiggy, to keep us thoroughly entertained and our shoes perfectly muddy.<br /><br />I have a dream that after the hash, regardless of the weather or the outcome of the accusations, soup will be served, and that each hasher will remember their responsibility and bring their own personal bowl and spoon to receive their nourishment.<br /><br />This is our hope. This is the faith that I go back to the trail with.<br /><br />--Likes It In the Kitchen	11/20/25 9:48 (kitchen) 1.28
